      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Right now, the only way to get your sanity back is to get the Lotus Flower,
    which lies at the center of the forest. This is also the only way to win the
    game.


    Getting your sanity down to 0 is an automatic Game Over, same goes
    for your health.


    That''s all! Sorry for the long texts, I hope I didn''t
    get too carried away.

    Anyway, I hope you enjoy the game!!'
